{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released invocation-end ordering contract.** Existing API documentation promises registration order, so reversing legacy end hooks in a patch release can break plugins whose cleanup depends on that ordering. Keep forward order for existing plugins and add an explicit/versioned LIFO opt-in for scope-owning plugins, with mixed legacy/OTel compatibility tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-DvED","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"6681f426192eb1f1c2a804886d787f9c12fc435fc7ba8237dd1fbe5f8edb6787","observation_id":"aro_v1_m2a7ijqzf2y7dqviaseg26d7tq","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_62wdld7koxfwbrcicgdzh24kdi","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"176b60f75bf45011daa7ad761a270612fe30a50c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_zkx63ykybwo3q27dktrxs635tl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
